& [Constructive]
  + reuse already-tested exact legacy proposal and Ed25519 verifier; add the missing chain associations without introducing a second signing format
  + fifteen positive fields make useful correspondence observable and thirty-three false fields preserve authority boundaries

& [Adversarial]
  + an attacker can replace a validly signed policy and recompute hashes; decode-key and A1/A3 raw correspondence must reject it
  + an attacker can replace a validly signed decision under an unchanged request; expected UUID kind and external identity must reject it
  + an attacker can rebind unsigned request metadata to another valid A4 witness; this may be valid descriptive association but never signed A4 coverage

& [Resolution]
  + no new signature context; all signed-A4-coverage claims are false
  + require exact upstream receipts and only-A5 packet transition; half-open expiry is explicit and independently tested
  + this is one agent's two analytical passes, not an independent human review or delegated review
